# Repository safety

## Protected production paths

These need an explicit owner order before any change:

- `production/ops/kpi_policy.json`, `production/ops/line_floor_policy.json`, `production/ops/live_krate_ensemble.json`
- `production/odds/odds_board.py`, `production/odds/poll_odds.py`
- `src/Python/market.py`, `src/Python/count_layer.py`, `src/Python/live_assembly.py`, `src/Python/odds_ledger.py`
- Model artifacts under `artifacts/models/`, Modal schedules/crons, ledger/pointers.

## Research never edits production

- Research writes shadow columns beside live values. Zero live-path change until a gated promotion with sign-off + revert path.
- Never edit live scorers, policy JSONs, schedules, or ledgers from a research task.
- Never train/score, run backtests, or run the 2026 retrospective unless the backlog explicitly approves it.

## Generated paths

`data/`, `artifacts/`, `.venv/`, `.hypothesis/`, `.pytest_cache/` are generated/ignored. Never commit them. Never glob parquet to "discover" the repo.

## Safe read-only commands

`python production/odds/grade_odds_ledger.py --status --curve`, `python scripts/check_notebook_artifacts.py`, `python -m pytest -q`, `git status --short`, `git diff --stat`.
